<title>USA: Abatix Environmental to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Abatix Environmental to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abatix Environmental Corp said its board approved a plan to repurchase up to 150,000 shares of stock.</p>
<p>The company said it was not imediately available to comment on the number of shares the company currently has outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
